WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.880
Meet webfaCe Desk. The admin you never had, minding your business day and night.

2
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:19.760
Six thirty. Overnight enquiries are sorted. Here's one: Dana wants a new website. Desk reads it and tells you what she's after.

3
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:39.380
It writes the reply in your words. It doesn't send it. You read it, you say yes.

4
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:59.900
Dana wants a call on Thursday. Desk checks your calendar, holds the time, and tells her — once you say so.

5
00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:20.780
A quote, priced from your own price list. Never a made up number.

6
00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.900
You tell it about your business once. We set it up with you, and we stay.

7
00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:51.660
webfaCe Desk. Minding your business, 24/7. webfaCe Desk dot app.
